---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy" description="How OmniReach handles information submitted through the public website contact form.">
  <section class="page-hero legal-hero"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow"><span></span>Privacy</p><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p>Effective October 12, 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section legal-section">
    <div class="shell legal-copy">
      <p>This notice explains how OmniReach handles information submitted through this website.</p>
      <h2>Information you provide</h2>
      <p>The contact form collects your name, email address, message, and any optional phone or business information you choose to provide.</p>
      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use submitted information to review and respond to your inquiry, communicate about requested services, protect the form from abuse, and maintain reasonable business records.</p>
      <h2>Who receives your message</h2>
      <p>Contact submissions are emailed from OmniReach’s verified forms address to every active OmniReach Platform Owner account. Delivery is handled by our email service provider. We do not sell contact-form information.</p>
      <h2>Security and retention</h2>
      <p>The form uses rate limiting and a security challenge to reduce abuse. Messages may remain in recipient mailboxes and associated operational records for as long as reasonably needed to respond, maintain business records, or meet legal obligations.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 only when you choose “Allow analytics.” Until then, analytics storage is denied. When allowed, Google Analytics may use first-party cookies and collect usage information such as visited pages, approximate location, device details, and referral source so we can understand and improve the website. Advertising storage and personalized advertising remain disabled. You can change your choice at any time using “Analytics choices” in the footer. The form’s security challenge may separately use limited technical data to distinguish legitimate visitors from automated abuse.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You may choose not to submit the form. If you have a privacy question or want us to review information you previously submitted, use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> and identify your request.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update this notice when the website or our operating practices change. The effective date above identifies the current version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
